 "notes": "134.0 BPM grid fitted to drum stem. Verse = UK-garage 2-step (kick 1 and the \"and\" of 3, snare 2) charted as kick 0/10 with snare 4 every other bar; chorus = jersey-style kick on 2, 3, 3a, 4+ (steps 4,8,11,14) + downbeat snare; break = off-beat claps (steps 2,6,10,14). Old chart had 68 taps (0.62/s, first tap at 7.96 s) — far sparser than the music; new chart roughly doubles+ to 1.4/s while keeping verses at 2–3 taps per bar.",
